{"version":1,"content":"<p>今天（11月1日）是「世界純素日」，亦為「世界純素月」揭開序幕，近年愈來愈多人為健康、環保或減肥而選擇純素飲食，不過戒掉肉類、雞蛋及奶製品，是否就代表食得健康？</p><p>請來營養師拆解純素飲食的好處、常見營養不足問題及飲食迷思，教大家食得健康又均衡。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:12.128701+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T09:00:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.064371+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.064371+00:00","content_hash":"e6fe1ef79417df7390519778261b170185000ccd5b4f9f1f84219480addad8a2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}